{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "131", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The Tigers' bowlers kept it tight early on and just gave away 55 runs in the first 10 overs. However, their bowling figures were later disturbed from the hammering they received in the last 10. Rubel Hossain was the pick of the bowlers, scalping 3 wickets. Shakib and Mosaddek kept it tight and gave away just 49 runs from their 7.4 overs with the latter picking up a wicket. Taskin gave just 8 off his first 2 overs and then 29 off his last 2. The skipper was taken to all parts but was unlucky as he had 2 catches dropped of his bowling. The experiment of bowling Sarkar for an over didn't work either for them as he gave away 21 runs. Stay tuned as we come back with the chase shortly!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "130", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Great comeback by the Kiwis in the last 10! They scored humongous 139 runs in these last 10 and lost just one wicket. The experiment of opening with Neesham didn't work. Last match's centurion, Munro followed him and went for a duck. They lost Bruce too soon after! But, after that a huge 124-run partnership off just 72 balls between Williamson and Anderson took New Zealand to a position of command. The skipper brought all his experience to count sailing through the storm calmly and then taking the charge. Anderson followed his captain and remained true to his reputation by smashing bowlers to all parts.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "129", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "NEW ZEALAND FINISH ON 194/4! Great finish by the hosts courtesy an unbeaten 94 from Corey Anderson. They scored 69 runs in the last 5 overs. Williamson was looking dangerous but Rubel Hossain sent him packing, ending the 124-run partnership. The skipper, Mortaza got injured while fielding off his own bowling and he too like Kayes left the field. Mosaddek Hossain completed his over. Apart from Shakib, the other bowlers weren't spared in these last 5 and went for plenty.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.6", "Id": "128", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58314", "Batsman": "4332", "Commentary": "2 runs.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.5", "Id": "127", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58314", "Batsman": "4332", "Commentary": "SIX.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.4", "Id": "126", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58314", "Batsman": "4332", "Commentary": "No run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.3", "Id": "125", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58314", "Batsman": "11703", "Commentary": "1 run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "19.2", "Id": "124", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58314", "Batsman": "4332", "Commentary": "1 run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type